<title>UK: Commerzbank warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Deutsche Telekom, lead manager Commerz Financial said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	  STRIKE	    ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A	    30.00 DEM	 5.80 DEM</p>
<p> CALL B	    35.00 DEM	 3.25 DEM</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.NOV.96-18.MAR.98   PAYDATE	04.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
